@startuml
' Educational conceptual UML for a signed double-entry journal.
class Account {
 +id: ID
+currency: ISO4217
+open: boolean
}
class Journal {
 +id: ID
+transferRef: String
+recordedAt: Instant
}
class Posting {
 +id: ID
+signedAmount: Decimal
}
Journal "1" -- "2..*" Posting : contains
Account "1" -- "0..*" Posting : account
note bottom of Journal
  Sum of posting amounts is zero.
  Cross-row invariant needs a trusted posting API.
end note
@enduml
